To use the following configurations with servo drives other than Lichuan,           
only the ethercat-conf.xml file needs to be reviewed and adjusted according to the manual or ESI file    
provided by the servo drive manufacturer.    
Compare the corresponding index numbers.    
    
Vendor ID. vid="00000766"pid="00000402"    
Object Group Number.    
pdo idx="1600"    
Object number.    
pdoEntry idx="6040" bitLen="16"    
also slave idx="0" type="EK1100"    
Modify these values accordingly for the objects you are interested in.    
These changes are supposed to be cosmetic only.    
   
